00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:57,400
 When I was getting overwhelmed, I had this new baby, and I was working at Newsweek, and

11
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:00,680
 I realized that there was just more to the story than I could do myself, it would have

12
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:04,160
 taken me like double the time.

