00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,860
 We were at his house in Woodside, and we went out into the garage.

23
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:15,120
 This is how un-researched this topic was, because, you know, who'd have thunk, right?

24
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:20,920
 And we go out into his garage, and there are all these boxes of old, mildewy papers, and

