00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:28,360
 he starts pulling them out, and there are old letters between him and people at MIT,

26
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:33,400
 and then he pulls out this amazing set of sketches of him.

27
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:38,720
 It's like, remember when Trudeau Doonesbury did Inside Reagan's Brain?

28
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:42,560
 This was like inside Larry Roberts' brain.

29
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:49,540
 He was just sketching out all the possible configurations of what this network could

30
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:50,540
 look like.

